WEBVTT

00:04:25.858 --> 00:04:30.604
Before China adopted
economic reform 37 years ago,

00:04:31.118 --> 00:04:34.557
it maintained policies
to keep the country poor.

00:04:35.218 --> 00:04:39.659
Then in 1979, it implemented
economic reform.

00:04:39.683 --> 00:04:43.436
It allowed international trade
and foreign investment.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:45.588
And we all know what happened --

00:04:45.612 --> 00:04:48.260
China's the fastest-growing economy.

00:04:48.284 --> 00:04:49.765
But here's something:

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:53.328
In that nation, in 1990,

00:04:53.352 --> 00:04:56.772
the annual income was only $980.

00:04:57.137 --> 00:05:01.980
Fast-forward to 2015,
it's a little over $14,000.